{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-05_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-05","title":"コール","storyCode":"3-5","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3f46eb87989c4a4bf8e0f6c345542c752ad2dadf7f862cad5f63b213676cab54","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ドクターの前で人を殺めたことにアーミヤは動揺してしまう。しかし、ドクターにかけられた言葉で、彼女は自らを取り戻し、改めてドクターを守り続けることを約束した。\n一方、一度退却したレユニオンたちは、スカルシュレッダーを救うべく引き返してきた。Wもそれに加勢するようだ。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十七关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ドク、ター……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……わ、たし……そんな、つもりじゃ……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――霧が、晴れていく……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……近衛局からの通信が入りました。レユニオンの残した痕跡を多数確認したとのことです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"なお、現在追跡中のターゲットは、白い髪をした女性で――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤさん、チェン隊長からご伝言が……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――顔色が優れないようですね。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"この場は任せてほしい。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかりました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"お願いします、Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"可能であれば、5分以内に出立できたらと思っておりますので……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ドクター……"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怖いのか？　アーミヤ。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"わた、しは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……何も、怖くなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…………いえ。ドクターの言う通りです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……また失うことになったらと思うと、どうしても怖くて……"}]},{"label":"……自分の力が、嫌になったとか？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……自分でも、よくわかりません……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"どう言えばいいのかも、わからないんですが……それでも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この力は……人を傷つけるためだけのものではないんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だから……ドクターには、見られたくありませんでした……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私が、誰かの命を奪うところなんて。"}]},{"label":"後悔する必要はない。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……はい。後悔は、していません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……と、いうより……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターのためなら、相手が何を背負っていようと、殺めることに後悔はしません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが……本当は、もっといい方法があったはずだとも思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私がそれを見つけ出すことができなかったから、彼の命を奪うことになってしまったんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"その一点だけは……悔やまずにいられません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……できることなら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターにだけは、こんな姿を見せたくありませんでした。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"普段は、この大地に生きる感染者たちを、苦しみから救ってみせると口にしているのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"いざ危機的な状況に陥ったときには、いつも自分を無理やり納得させて、彼らの命を奪う選択をしてしまっているんですから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は、本当に無力ですね。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"それでも、君が守ってくれたことは事実だ。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……なんだか、わかった気がします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それが、私のやるべきことなんですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――私は、運命なんて存在しないと思っているんです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが、それでも……この先、何があったとしても。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私は、あなたを守ってみせます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"絶対に。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"！　マズい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"お前ら、先に行ってろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"俺はスカルシュレッダーを助けに行く！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"お前なあ……気でも狂ったのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"一人で行くのは自殺みたいなもんだ。……俺たちも行くに決まってんだろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　すまん、恩に着る！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつを置き去りにするなんて、できやしなくてよ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなの、俺も同じさ。――行くぞ、皆！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンが……引き返して来る……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一体、何のつもりだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマさん！　撤退しましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"了解です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――近衛局各員に告ぐ！　気を抜かず、攻撃に備えろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"突っ込むぞ！　援護してくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"くそっ、この女……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメだ、こんな盾歯が立たない！　俺たちじゃ相手にならないぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"急いで回り込め！　奴らが態勢を整える前に……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、スカルシュレッダーを――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつを取り戻すんだ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスの皆さん！　奴らの目的が変わったようです、注意してください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　危ない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマさん！　右から来ます！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――ッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あら、防がれちゃった。ふふっ――やるじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"爆弾？　――奇襲をかけてきたか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あははっ！　もちろん、それで終わりじゃないわよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたには、じっくり相手してもらうから――よそ見しないでね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ――また爆発か……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"まったく、どこから潜り込まれたのやら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤさん！　こちらは、遠距離からの爆撃を受けて動けません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ほかのレユニオンがそちらへ向かっていますので、お気をつけて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"へ～え。その盾、ほんとに頑丈みたいね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"……にしても、うっかり自分から面倒事に首突っ込んじゃったけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、たまにはレユニオンに貢献してあげるとしましょうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"――それじゃ、せいぜい楽しませてちょうだいね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……チェルノボーグで遭遇した、Wです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかして、近衛局の追跡を振り切ってきたんでしょうか……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、早くホシグマさんを援護しなくては！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、注意して対応してください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンはまだ大勢潜伏しているはずですから、痕跡を頼りに先手を打っていかないと、不利な状況に陥りかねません！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ドクター！　各小隊の指揮をお願いします！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["ホシグマ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
